TITLE Equilibrate pure water with fixed-pressure gas mixture at 150C; report SI of N2(g)
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 150
    CH4(g) 0.4 10
    CO2(g) 0.4 10
    NH3(g) 0.2 5
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -si N2(g)
END
